{"about_the_game":"The Final Farewell is a cosy narrative adventure where you play as a lonely ghost. Among the shadows and echoes of the Whispering Woods, a misty Veil has fallen. Rumours abound of lost mortals who\u2019ve had their memories stolen by the mist, and precious trinkets lie in wait, ready to be found\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/extras/e4a65a5f02c9e9998509f60d6db0b29d.avif?t=1723557451\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br>You\u2019ve awoken to find you have no memory of your past - and you\u2019re a ghost! How did you come to pass? Memories once lost are not gone forever\u2026 Can you discover the clues of your former life and finally be at peace?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/extras/e4f2cd909a2be868ecef4e2ad306cdd4.avif?t=1723557451\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/extras/6e9bcfb908fe1f48ae9ce02283ccf0c1.avif?t=1723557451\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br>Seek out lost mortals who have come to lay their loved ones to rest. The misty Veil wipes their memories each time they venture into its murky haze, so it\u2019s up to you to help locate forgotten trinkets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/extras/798a28b786dc328db52a3b0b5b058d53.avif?t=1723557451\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br>Stay close to the light of campfires to lift your spirits and avoid the dangerous mist of the Veil. There are many secrets to be found in the Woods - but do you dare take the time to look? Spend too long, and the Veil will close in before you can return to your new mortal friend!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/extras/3b693fd9857c850423af00e2273e1b91.poster.avif?t=1723557451\" width=594 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/extras/3b693fd9857c850423af00e2273e1b91.webm?t=1723557451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/extras/3b693fd9857c850423af00e2273e1b91.mp4?t=1723557451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Inspect and identify precious belongings to see if you can assist in triggering a memory or two! As each mortal recalls their past, they grow one step closer to putting their loved one to rest - and saying goodbye forever.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/extras/9159058695e2d840bc0bb50b99f212d5.poster.avif?t=1723557451\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/extras/9159058695e2d840bc0bb50b99f212d5.webm?t=1723557451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/extras/9159058695e2d840bc0bb50b99f212d5.mp4?t=1723557451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/extras/c4a8df3dba5681bfcf60c4f4fc71a892.avif?t=1723557451\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br>A landing place for spirits, the Solstice Shrine is your force of teleportation to the Whispering Woods. In the safety of the Shrine, you can recharge and guide mortals to bid their loved ones adieu.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/extras/52d56dc8cf7eec88869ea6c0e0ceb408.poster.avif?t=1723557451\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/extras/52d56dc8cf7eec88869ea6c0e0ceb408.webm?t=1723557451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/extras/52d56dc8cf7eec88869ea6c0e0ceb408.mp4?t=1723557451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unlock spiritual assistance as you complete each mortal\u2019s story, allowing you to tackle the Veil with an extra advantage. Whether with a dash of light, or an encouraging word, each ghostly entity can help you find precious trinkets and uncover new memories!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2803140?t=1723557451","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1723557451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1723557451","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1723557451","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Themes include death, grief & implied suicide."},"detailed_description":"The Final Farewell is a cosy narrative adventure where you play as a lonely ghost. Among the shadows and echoes of the Whispering Woods, a misty Veil has fallen. Rumours abound of lost mortals who\u2019ve had their memories stolen by the mist, and precious trinkets lie in wait, ready to be found\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/extras/e4a65a5f02c9e9998509f60d6db0b29d.avif?t=