0e93.1920x1080.jpg?t=1723557451","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803140/ss_6102b1234e65e804b42e5cd99672cab23dbc0e93.600x338.jpg?t=1723557451"}],"short_description":"The Final Farewell is a cosy narrative adventure about finding peace in death, and learning to let go. As a lost ghost, befriend wayward mortals and piece together misty memories. Lay to rest the echoes of the past and discover the truth of your own demise.","steam_appid":2803140,"support_info":{"email":"studio@lovewishgames.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://bit.ly/m/studiowitchstar"}